<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Team Charter — {{ team_name }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Team Charter — {{ team_name }}</h1>
<h2>Mission</h2>
<p>[What we are here to accomplish — one sentence tied to business outcome]</p>
<h2>Members</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Role</th><th>Expertise</th><th>Contact</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ name }}</td><td>[Role]</td><td>{{ area }}</td><td>{{ email_handle }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Working Agreements</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Communication:</strong> Slack for async; video calls for decisions requiring discussion</li><li><strong>Availability:</strong> Core overlap hours [X:00am–Y:00pm timezone]</li><li><strong>Decisions:</strong> Consensus preferred; [role] breaks ties on {{ domain }} decisions</li><li><strong>Conflict:</strong> Address directly first; escalate to PM if unresolved within 48h</li><li><strong>Code:</strong> PR review within 24 hours; 2 approvals required before merge</li></ol>
<h2>Meeting Cadence</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Meeting</th><th>Frequency</th><th>Duration</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Standup</td><td>Daily</td><td>15 min</td><td>Sync and surface blockers</td></tr><tr><td>Sprint Planning</td><td>Bi-weekly</td><td>2 hrs</td><td>Plan next sprint</td></tr><tr><td>Sprint Review</td><td>Bi-weekly</td><td>1 hr</td><td>Demo to stakeholders</td></tr><tr><td>Retrospective</td><td>Bi-weekly</td><td>1 hr</td><td>Improve process</td></tr><tr><td>1-on-1</td><td>Weekly</td><td>30 min</td><td>PM with each member</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Success Metrics</h2>
<ul><li>Sprint velocity (baseline: [N] points/sprint)</li><li>Defect escape rate (&lt;[N]% per sprint)</li><li>Team satisfaction (monthly pulse, target ≥7/10)</li></ul>
<hr/>
<p><em>Review this charter every 8-10 weeks or after any team-composition change.</em></p>
</body></html>
